+Render encoders reuse up to four immutable set-zero descriptor snapshots, each of at most
+32 writes. Matching includes the pipeline layout, descriptor type, binding and array element,
+and the complete resolved Vulkan buffer/image/texel-view descriptor. Cache hits do not rewrite
