+points, and ordinary resource retention keeps their handles alive. Rebinds are resolved before
+matching; replay starts an empty encoder. Push constants, heap-set updates, hazard tracking and
+shadow copies retain their ordinary paths. `WorkCounts` exposes arena allocations and render
+set reuse separately, for verification without interpreting queue submissions as frames.
